# Absolute production origin used for canonical and Open Graph URLs.
#
# Optional. On Vercel and Cloudflare Pages the platform's assigned origin is
# detected at build time and inlined automatically (via vite.config.ts), and is
# also read from the server at runtime — no configuration needed for the default
# deployment domain.
#
# Set VITE_SITE_URL explicitly only to override that (e.g. a custom domain, or a
# stable canonical across preview builds). It takes precedence everywhere.
#
# Protocol is optional (https is assumed); a trailing slash is dropped.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.com
